aceita essas diferenças', 999.0, 425.53, NULL, 'Mom & Baby > Toys > Dolls & Stuffed Toys', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81ztd-ml0s7gurwef66f', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F497594085%2F50256318506', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
