h this essence-type cream from the brand HOLIKA HOLIKA ! Aloe Waterproof Suncream SPF50 +: usage tips As the last step of the skincare routine, apply Aloe Waterproof Suncream SPF50 + cream in good quantity to the skin, making it penetrate well. Add more during the day if necessary! For what type of skin The cream is for all skin types. It is composed of sagebrush and carrot extract that soothes the skin. Agents like ceramides deeply hydrate the skin to fight dry skin. It prevents oxidative damage thanks to its rosehip fruit extract. The complexion is also improved, more radiant. The extract of apple and apricot juice has a preventive anti-aging effect, often accelerated by exposure to the sun. [option] ❤︎ aloe waterproof sunblock spf50+ pa+++ 70g [weight] 70g #sunblock #aloe #Suncare #Sunscreen #sunbase #holikaholika #sun #K-beauty #KOKSARA ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ♡Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√', 83.33, 81.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Face Sunscreen', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-23020-kf0j5m9rsvnv63', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F19374004803', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
